        },
{
          "text": "$0$",
          "why": "Evaluated $f(g(-2))$ instead of $g(f(-2))$."
        },
{
          "text": "$7$",
          "why": "Miscalculated $f(-2) = 6 - 4 = 2$ and evaluated $g(2) = 7$."
        },
{
          "text": "$3$",
          "why": "Evaluated $g(-2)$ directly instead of first evaluating the inner function $f(-2)$ and then applying $g$."
